## Project Structure

```
com.example.mygramkata/
├── data/
│   ├── entity/          → Customer.kt, Transaction.kt
│   ├── dao/             → CustomerDao.kt, TransactionDao.kt
│   ├── database/        → GramaKhataDatabase.kt
│   └── repository/      → GramaKhataRepository.kt, AiRepository.kt
├── viewmodel/           → GramaKhataViewModel.kt
├── ui/
│   ├── MainActivity.kt
│   ├── customers/       → CustomerListFragment, CustomerDetailFragment
│   │                      AddCustomerDialog, AddTransactionDialog
│   │                      CustomerAdapter
│   ├── transactions/    → TransactionAdapter
│   └── dashboard/       → DashboardFragment, DueListAdapter
└── utils/               → Converters.kt
```

