## Setup Instructions

### Prerequisites
- Android Studio Panda (2025.3.1) or later
- Android device or emulator (API 24+)
- Google Gemini API key (free from https://aistudio.google.com)

### Steps

**1. Clone the repository**
```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/GramaKhata.git
```

**2. Open in Android Studio**
- File → Open → Select GramaKhata folder
- Wait for Gradle sync to complete

**3. Add your Gemini API key**

Open `app/src/main/java/com/example/mygramkata/data/repository/AiRepository.kt`

```kotlin
private val API_KEY = "YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE"
```

Get your free API key from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey

**4. Run the app**
- Connect Android device with USB Debugging ON
- Click Run ▶ in Android Studio
- Minimum SDK: Android 7.0 (API 24)

---

## How It Works

### Adding a Customer
1. Open app → Customers tab
2. Tap green + button
3. Enter name and phone → Save

### Recording a Transaction
1. Tap on a customer
2. Tap **+ PAID** when customer pays money
3. Tap **− DUE** when customer takes goods on credit
4. Enter amount → Save
5. Balance updates instantly!

### WhatsApp Reminder
1. Open customer with pending due
2. Tap **WhatsApp** button
3. AI generates polite reminder
4. WhatsApp opens with pre-filled message

### AI Daily Report
1. Go to Dashboard tab
2. Enter your shop name
3. Tap **Generate AI Daily Report**
4. Gemini AI analyzes all dues and generates summary

---

## Database Schema

### customers table
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| id | INTEGER (PK) | Auto-generated ID |
| name | TEXT | Customer name |
| phone | TEXT | Phone number |
| photoUri | TEXT | Optional photo |
| createdAt | LONG | Creation timestamp |

### transactions table
| Column | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| id | INTEGER (PK) | Auto-generated ID |
| customerId | INTEGER (FK) | References customers.id |
| amount | DOUBLE | Transaction amount |
| type | ENUM | CREDIT or DEBIT |
| note | TEXT | Optional note |
| timestamp | LONG | Transaction timestamp |

